569
00:58:46,617 --> 00:58:48,117
Why ?

570
00:58:55,200 --> 00:58:56,408
Mr Chang .

571
01:00:00,528 --> 01:00:03,820
( Anti-communist and Anti-Russian aggression song )

572
01:00:14,319 --> 01:00:16,652
